Today, you will hear the complete story of humanity’s fiercest defender against the forces of Hell. I will tell you the story of the marine known as Doomguy, the Doom Slayer, the space marine, the Doom Marine, the Wanderer, the Slayer, the Hellwalker—or simply Flynn Taggart. 

Following the release of Doom Eternal, it became possible to piece together a more or less complete history of Doomguy, while the release of the new DLC for Doom The Dark Ages finally established a fully developed new canon. You will learn who Doomguy was before the gates of Hell opened on Mars’s moons, Phobos and Deimos; how he was cast a thousand years into the past and became the greatest demon slayer in history; how and from whom he received his divine powers; how he came to lead a formidable army of demon hunters; how he uncovered Heaven’s conspiracy against every living being in the universe; and many other fascinating facts from the history of the Doom Slayer. 

